    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<div><br></div><div>I am new to using ggtree and have been trying to install the package by following the instructions mentioned on the github page. However, I am getting the error shown below. Any help would be much appreciated!</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">&gt; source(&quot;<a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482799588000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0MGP5IfdvSIWlpA2c5WkfR\">https://bioconductor.org/biocLite.R</a>&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Bioconductor version 3.4 (BiocInstaller 1.24.0), ?biocLite for help</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">&gt; biocLite(&quot;ggtree&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">BioC_mirror: <a href=\"https://bioconductor.org/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioconductor.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482799588000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IAe5Y187Muj_uAMw0v8wt\">https://bioconductor.org</a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Using Bioconductor 3.4 (BiocInstaller 1.24.0), R 3.3.0 (2016-05-03).</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Installing package(s) ‘ggtree’</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">installation path not writeable, unable to update packages: cluster, codetools, foreign, lattice, Matrix,</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">  mgcv, nlme, survival</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Old packages: &#39;party&#39;, &#39;spatstat&#39;</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Update all/some/none? [a/s/n]: </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">a</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">I typed <b>a</b> to update all, but does not make a difference. </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Finally get this error:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><div>Warning message:</div><div>package ‘ggtree’ is not available (for R version 3.3.0) </div><div><br></div><div>-Vijay</div></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
